/Title (Create a tool that replicates the CMS automated criteria to check process for network adequacy while ensuring data accuracy. This tool should evaluate county-specialty pairs to identify gaps based on time, distance, and other guidelines set by federal organizations for Medicare, Medicaid, and Commercial lines of business.)
