<<
/Title (Member Feedback Integration involves collecting direct feedback from members about their experiences with provider accessibility and network adequacy. By surveying members on factors like ease of finding in-network providers, travel time, appointment availability, and overall satisfaction, NetSure can gain valuable insights into areas where the network meets expectations and where improvements are needed. This approach helps identify gaps in service quality, ensuring that network adjustments are not only CMS-compliant but also aligned with member needs and satisfaction)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 20 0 R
/Prev 1464 0 R
/Next 690 0 R
>>
